    "title": "Police Renew Request for Information Regarding Missing Pāhoa Man - NewsBreak",
    "text": "12 hours ago Hawai’i Island police are renewing their request for information regarding the disappearance of 37-year-old Kelly Gravitt of Pāhoa. Gravitt, a combat-wounded Army veteran and Purple Heart recipient, is described as Caucasian, 6 feet tall, 180 pounds, with brown hair, blue eyes, and a thick auburn beard. He has numerous tattoos and distinct scars on his lower legs from prior injuries. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
